{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02633","headline":"游仙四首 二 · 王绩","name":"游仙四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上月芝兰径，中岩紫翠房。\n金壶新练乳，玉釜始煎香。\n六局黄公术，三门赤帝方。\n吹沙聊作鸟，动石试爲羊。\n缑氏还程促，瀛洲会日长。\n谁知北岩下，延首咏霓裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}